    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d152">

                <pb facs="0255" n="151" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg151"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File. No. 893.51/1274.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American Minister.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—:Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-02-04">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 4, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your February 4, as to nationality of advisers. The Department fully approves
                    your position and will accept either solution suggested by you at the
                    conference. If immediate settlement cannot be reached, urge postponement of
                    discussion of nominations in order that advances may not be delayed. The Russian
                    demand seems untimely and unreasonable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
